# Keep the build context small & secrets out of image layers.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.cowork-tmp
documentation
**/*.log

# Env files — never bake secrets into images.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* reach the build via --build-arg instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
